OL,3,AViolent clashes, looting and buildings
OL,4,Aablaze in France as more than 1,200
OL,5,Aarrested after protests
OL,6,
OL,7,FViolence broke out across France on
OL,8,FSaturday during the latest day of
OL,9,Fdemonstrations against hardship in
OL,10,Fschools and the cost of living.
OL,12,FAt least 1,200 people were arrested
OL,13,Fduring what the French government
OL,14,Fdescribed as an "escalation in
OL,15,Fviolence" alongside an estimated
OL,16,F550,000 taking to the streets.
OL,18,FIn Paris, there were significant
OL,19,Fclashes into the evening with riot
OL,20,Fpolice, who used tear gas and water
OL,21,Fcannon on crowds.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
