OL,3,AViolent clashes, looting and buildings
OL,4,Aablaze in France as more than 1,200
OL,5,Aarrested after protests
OL,6,
OL,7,FBuildings were set alight in the
OL,8,Fcapital and other areas, including in
OL,9,FLimoges where a large fire in the town
OL,10,Fhall caused the roof to partly
OL,11,Fcollapse.
